{"id": "0x70EA", "plain_text": "That scary-looking man took\noff out of here really fast!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70EB", "plain_text": "Oh so scary...\nOh so scary...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70EC", "plain_text": "Hey, what do you want?\nI don't have time to talk\nto you!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70ED", "plain_text": "Please...with [C]...\nPlease sell me something...\nPlease...with [C]...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_70)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["C"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70EE", "plain_text": "No...\nThat's not what I want...\nI want something inside a bottle...\nI didn't mean that thing...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70EF", "plain_text": "No...\nI can't take that...\nThat's not what I want to buy...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F0", "plain_text": "Oh, that's Blue Fire!\nI'll buy it for 150 Rupees!\nAll sales final, OK?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F1", "plain_text": "Oh, a Fish!\nI'll buy it for 100 Rupees!\nAll sales final, OK?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_69)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F2", "plain_text": "Oh, it's a cute little Bug!\nI'll buy it for 50 Rupees!\nAll sales final, OK?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F3", "plain_text": "Oh, a darling little Fairy!\nI'll buy it for 25 Rupees!\nAll sales final, OK?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F4", "plain_text": "Oh...you are quite an energetic\nyoung man. You're brave and\nhandsome, too.\n--- PAGE ---\nHeh heh heh...your name is\n[PLAYER], isn't it.\n--- PAGE ---\nHeh heh he...don't be surprised.\nI can read people's minds.\n--- PAGE ---\nIf I looked as good as you, I\ncould run a different kind of \nbusiness...heh he heh...\n--- PAGE ---\nMy shop is the only Ghost Shop\nin Hyrule.\n--- PAGE ---\nBecause of the great Ganondorf, \nit is a fine time for a business \nlike this...heh heh heh...\n--- PAGE ---\nOh...I can only hope the world \ngets even worse!\n--- PAGE ---\nThe ghosts, called Poes, are \nspirits of concentrated hatred \nthat appear in the fields and \ngraveyard. They hate the world!\n--- PAGE ---\nYoung man, if you catch a Poe, I\nwill pay a lot of money for it...\nHeh heh hee!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "NAME", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F5", "plain_text": "Hey, young man. What's happening \ntoday? If you have a Poe, I will \nbuy it.\n--- PAGE ---\nYour card now has  points.\nCome back again!\nHeh heh heh!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_69)", "HIGHSCORE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F6", "plain_text": "Oh, you brought a Poe today!\n--- PAGE ---\n........\n--- PAGE ---\nHmmm...\n--- PAGE ---\nThis is a normal Poe.\nHere are your 10 Rupees.\nTake them.\n--- PAGE ---\nHeh heh.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "TEXT_SPEED", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F7", "plain_text": "Oh, you brought a Poe today!\n--- PAGE ---\nHmmmm!\n--- PAGE ---\nVery interesting!\nThis is a Big Poe!\n--- PAGE ---\nI'll buy it for 50 Rupees.\n--- PAGE ---\nOn top of that, I'll put 100\npoints on your card.\n--- PAGE ---\nIf you earn 1,000 points, you'll\nbe a happy man! Heh heh.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F8", "plain_text": "Wait a minute! WOW!\n--- PAGE ---\nYou have earned 1,000 points!\n--- PAGE ---\nYoung man, you are a genuine\nGhost Hunter!\n--- PAGE ---\nIs that what you expected me to\nsay? Heh heh heh!\n--- PAGE ---\nBecause of you, I have extra\ninventory of Big Poes, so this will\nbe the last time I can buy a \nghost.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou're thinking about what I \npromised would happen when you\nearned 1,000 points. Heh heh.\n--- PAGE ---\nDon't worry, I didn't forget.\nJust take this.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70F9", "plain_text": "Oh? What's that?\n--- PAGE ---\nIs that...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "TEXT_SPEED", "QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70FA", "plain_text": "a fairy?!\n--- PAGE ---\nThen, are you...\nAre you from the forest?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70FB", "plain_text": "Then...then...you wouldn't happen to\nhave...the Spiritual Stone of the \nForest, would you?! That green \nand shining stone...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70FC", "plain_text": "I had a dream...In the dream,\ndark storm clouds were billowing\nover the land of Hyrule...\n--- PAGE ---\nBut suddenly, a ray of light shot\nout of the forest, parted the\nclouds and lit up the ground...\n--- PAGE ---\nThe light turned into a figure\nholding a green and shining stone,\nfollowed by a fairy...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70FD", "plain_text": "I know this is a prophecy that\nsomeone would come from the\nforest...\n--- PAGE ---\nYes, I thought you might\nbe the one...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70FE", "plain_text": "Oh, I'm sorry!\n--- PAGE ---\nI got carried away with my story \nand didn't even properly introduce \nmyself!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "SHIFT", "BOX_BREAK", "NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x70FF", "plain_text": "I am Zelda, Princess of Hyrule.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7100", "plain_text": "What? Have we met before?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7101", "plain_text": "Awww... That's so cute!\nCould you tell me where you\nfound it?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7102", "plain_text": "Yeeeah!\nHelp me!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7103", "plain_text": "Uh...yeah? So what?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7104", "plain_text": "I hate foxes!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7105", "plain_text": "How irritating!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7106", "plain_text": "Hey, you look good!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7107", "plain_text": "YEEEAH! What's your problem?!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7108", "plain_text": "Oooh...is that a Zora?\nThose cool eyes are really\nfascinating...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7109", "plain_text": "Oh no! You're scary!\nDon't come any closer!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x710A", "plain_text": "Wow...how nostalgic! That\nreminds me of when I was a\nlittle kid.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x710B", "plain_text": "That's kind of funny...it\nmakes me laugh!\nHee hee!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x710C", "plain_text": "Uh-oh! I'm sorry, mom!\nOh...hey, it's you!\nDon't scare me like\nthat!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x710D", "plain_text": "What a big head you have!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x710E", "plain_text": "Oh, don't do that!\nI'm shy...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x710F", "plain_text": "Is there a mask competition\ngoing on? \nI'm going to vote for you!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7110", "plain_text": "Oh! A rabbit!\nSpeaking of rabbits, I saw a \nstrange man chasing rabbits \naround...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7111", "plain_text": "Oooh, what a pretty lady!\nBut you're kind of short,\naren't you?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7112", "plain_text": "Well...I can't think of anything\nfunny to say...sorry, kid!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7113", "plain_text": "A mask... When I was a little \nkid, I also wore masks around...\nWhat? You say you can't imagine\nme doing that?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7114", "plain_text": "Ohhhh...I see...\nIt's an illusion...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7115", "plain_text": "Hey, kid, don't grow up to be\nlike me...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7116", "plain_text": "AAAAAAAAAAAH!\nA GERUDO!!!!\n--- PAGE ---\nWha-? A mask?\nWhy do you have a mask \nlike that?!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7117", "plain_text": "Sorry, I'm busy right now.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7118", "plain_text": "Oh wow! It's Keaton!\nHi, Keaton!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7119", "plain_text": "How spooky!\nThere's a boy in Kakariko\nVillage who was looking for a\nmask like that!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x711A", "plain_text": "Hmm...well...don't you have any\nother masks?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x711B", "plain_text": "What a strange mask!\nHee hah haa!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x711C", "plain_text": "Hey kid! Can't you see we're\nbusy?! Leave us alone!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x711D", "plain_text": "I'm sorry. I don't even want to\nlook at any other woman!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x711E", "plain_text": "Hee hee.\nDon't pay any attention to that\nkid, my dear... Just pretend we're\nin our own, private little world...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x711F", "plain_text": "Oh, please!\nGo bother someone \nelse!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7120", "plain_text": "There's a rumor going around that\nthere is a Potion Shop that can\nmake the ultimate medicine!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7121", "plain_text": "I heard a rumor that there is a \nmonster that eats Hylian Shields\nsomewhere out there in the world.\nHave you ever seen it?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7122", "plain_text": "I came here to sell bombs...\nPlease buy some!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7123", "plain_text": "I...I am afraid...\nI have a feeling that man is going\nto destroy Hyrule.\n--- PAGE ---\nHe has such terrifying power!\n--- PAGE ---\nBut it's fortunate that you have \ncome...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7124", "plain_text": "What? If you want something,\njust make it clear!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7125", "plain_text": "I'm busy! Get out of my way,\nyou bum!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7126", "plain_text": "Hey, you have some good,\nquality wood there, kid!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7127", "plain_text": "Hrrrrm!\nGet out of my face!\nYou good for nothin'...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7128", "plain_text": "EEEEEEAAAAH!\nWhoops, I shouldn't scream like\nthat or the boss will yell at me!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7129", "plain_text": "Oh, sorry boss! \nI didn't mean to slack off!\nI'll get busy!\n--- PAGE ---\nOh, that's not you, boss?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x712A", "plain_text": "Gerudos are beautiful and brave...\nThey are just so fascinating!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x712B", "plain_text": "Someday, when I have more skill,\nI'll carve a mask like that one!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x712C", "plain_text": "Oh, that's the mask\neveryone is talking about!\nLooks kind of strange...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x712D", "plain_text": "Wa-ha-hah!\nHow's business,\nMr. Hero?\nHah hah hah!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x712E", "plain_text": "I'm on duty.\nUnderstand?\nON DUTY!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x712F", "plain_text": "Hmm, well, I don't really know\nwhat to say about that one...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7130", "plain_text": "Oh wow! Cute!\nBut Cuccos are much cuter!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7131", "plain_text": "Eh, what?\nAre you sad?\nHappy?\nI really can't tell...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7132", "plain_text": "I'm sorry, I'm not really\ninterested in that.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7133", "plain_text": "The little kid playing in the\ngraveyard was saying something\nabout his face...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7134", "plain_text": "I really am a good man.\nDon't you believe me?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7135", "plain_text": "WHAAAA--!\nI thought you were that old hag!\nDon't scare me like that!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7136", "plain_text": "I remember my father talking\nabout a swordsmith...but that\ndoesn't really matter to me\nanyway.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7137", "plain_text": "I'm not afraid of any forest \nmonsters! Are you trying to\nmake fun of me?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7138", "plain_text": "What is that? I can't see it\nvery well from here...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7139", "plain_text": "Hi again! How are you today?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x713A", "plain_text": "Everything's fine today!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x713B", "plain_text": "Tired...I'm so tired...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x713C", "plain_text": "I don't care about any\nfoxes!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x713D", "plain_text": "That's irritating!\nIt bothers my eyes!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x713E", "plain_text": "That looks quite handsome!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x713F", "plain_text": "Waaaaaaah!\nWhat is wrong with you?\nDo you have a bad attitude?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x7140", "plain_text": "You idiot! \nWhen you talk to someone, you\nshould make eye contact!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
